+|---|---|---|
+| Trace / Engrave 0.3 mm round B, gap 0.7 (flank 2.3 mm into A, 0.3 mm deep) | 0, **posts / posts** (the sim credits A the mark budget too) | op gouge, refused on both (by the op's moves on the turned stock) |
